@startuml
title UC-01 Clear a Combat Encounter
actor Player
boundary "Game Frontend" as UI
control "Combat System" as Combat
database "Game State" as State
Player -> UI: Attack during active encounter
UI -> Combat: Request attack
Combat -> State: Read range, cooldown and target HP
State --> Combat: Current state
alt Valid attack hits
 Combat -> State: Apply damage and start cooldown
 State --> Combat: Updated target HP
 Combat --> UI: Damage result
 UI --> Player: Show hit and updated health
else Action unavailable
 Combat --> UI: Reject action with reason
 UI --> Player: Show cooldown feedback
else Attack misses
 Combat --> UI: Miss result
 UI --> Player: Show miss feedback
end
par Enemy acts in real time
 Combat -> State: Resolve enemy movement / attacks
 State --> Combat: Updated Corgi HP
 Combat --> UI: Show changed status
else Player continues
 Player -> UI: Move, dash or use ability
end
opt Combat objective completed
 Combat -> State: Mark room clear; grant defined rewards
 Combat --> UI: Room clear result
 UI --> Player: Show outcome
end
@enduml
